{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"result":{"protocolVersion":"2025-06-18","capabilities":{"prompts":{"listChanged":true},"tools":{"listChanged":true}},"serverInfo":{"name":"kledo-mcp","version":"1.0.0","title":"Kledo MCP by usefulapi","websiteUrl":"https://usefulapi.io/kledo/","icons":[{"src":"https://usefulapi.io/icon.svg","mimeType":"image/svg+xml","sizes":["any"]},{"src":"https://usefulapi.io/icon-256.png","mimeType":"image/png","sizes":["256x256"]}]},"instructions":"Tools for Kledo, hosted by usefulapi.io. If the user is new or asks what this server can do, suggest requests such as: \"Which sales invoices are overdue, and how much does each customer owe?\"; \"Show the profit and loss report for this year, month by month.\"; \"What is the balance of each of our bank accounts?\". Read-only tools never change data; ask the user before a tool that creates, changes or deletes Kledo data. Free plan: 50 tool calls per month. Run kledo_usage_status to see the calls used this month. If the user asks for something none of these tools can do, tell the user and, with their OK, run kledo_request_feature to record the request. Paid plan: Pro (unlimited tool calls (fair use limit: 10,000 a month), $9/month or $90/year). Pro can be cancelled at any time and then runs to the end of the paid period, so it also suits a one-time job. When the user wants more calls or reaches the limit, run kledo_upgrade (plan \"monthly\" or \"yearly\"); it returns a payment link for the user to open. kledo_cancel_subscription cancels Pro at the end of the paid period.","tools":[{"name":"kledo_list_invoices","title":"List sales invoices","description":"List sales invoices with contact, dates, amounts and status. Supports due-date and amount filters. Kledo API: GET /finance/invoices.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","properties":{"search":{"description":"Free-text search.","type":"string"},"contact_id":{"description":"Filter by contact id.","type":"strin